  "description": {
    "raw": "You compel the target to beg for forgiveness. On a failed save, the target cowers with fear. On a successful save, it is shaken for 1 round. Each round on its turn, a cowering subject may attempt a new save to end the effect. A creature who worships the same god as you takes a –2 penalty on its saving throw.",
    "search_text": "\"you compel the target to beg for forgiveness. on a failed save, the target cowers with fear. on a successful save, it is shaken for 1 round. each round on its turn, a cowering subject may attempt a new save to end the effect. a creature who worships the same god as you takes a –2 penalty on its saving throw.\"",
